3                            =Total Number of Conductors (N+1)
5.0                          =Total Line Length (m)
10                           =NDZ
360                          =NDT  Must Have NDT>>NDZ*FINAL*V0/LEN
300.E-9                      =Final Solution Time
1                            =Print Solution Time Step Index
1                            =Conductor Having Source Voltage (at near end)
1                            =Conductor Having Load Voltage (at far end)
2                            =Output Conductor for Terminal Voltages
1   1    50.0       1.E3          =I,J,RS(I,J),RL(I,J)     (ohms)
1   2    0.0       0.0            =I,J,RS(I,J),RL(I,J)     (ohms)
2   2     1.E4    100.0           =I,J,RS(I,J),RL(I,J)     (ohms)
